      "text": "Heavy Rainfall Warning No. 25 #NCR_PRSD\nWeather System: Southwest Monsoon (Habagat)\nIssued at: 5:00 PM, 20 July 2025(Sunday)\n\nYELLOW WARNING LEVEL: Bataan, Pampanga and Zambales(Olongapo, Subic, Castillejos, San Marcelino, San Antonio, San Narciso, San Felipe, Botolan, Cabangan).\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: FLOODING in flood-prone areas.\nMeanwhile, expect light to moderate rains over Metro Manila, Cavite, Batangas and Rizal within the next 3 hours.\nLight to moderate with occasional heavy rains affecting Tarlac, Bulacan, Nueva Ecija and Zambales(Candelaria, Iba, Masinloc, Palauig, Santa Cruz) which may persist within 3 hours.\n\nThe public and the Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Offices concerned are advised to MONITOR the weather condition and watch for the next warning to be issued at 8:00 PM today.\nFor more information and queries, please call telephone numbers 8927-1335 and 8927-2877 or log on to https://t.co/59mTpZJq1n.",
